{"id": "FS-f33c947429f69f45", "question_type": "subjective", "stem": "11.(13分)(2025·乌鲁木齐模拟)已知函数f(x)=2x-(a)/(x)，且f(2)=(9)/(2).\n(1)求实数a的值；(3分)\n(2)判断函数f(x)在(1，+∞)上的单调性，并用定义证明；(6分)\n(3)求函数f(x)在[2，3]上的最值.(4分)", "explanation": "(1)因为f(x)=2x-(a)/(x)，且f(2)=(9)/(2)，\n所以4-(a)/(2)=(9)/(2)，解得a=-1.\n(2)函数f(x)在(1，+∞)上单调递增.证明如下：\n由(1)可得，f(x)=2x+(1)/(x)，\n任取x_(1)，x_(2)∈(1，+∞)，x_(1)<x_(2)，\n则f(x_(2))-f(x_(1))=2x_(2)+(1)/(x_(2))-(2x_(1)+(1)/(x_(1)))\n=2(x_(2)-x_(1))+((1)/(x_(2))−(1)/(x_(1)))\n=2(x_(2)-x_(1))+(x_(1)−x_(2))/(x_(1)x_(2))=(x_(2)-x_(1))(2−(1)/(x_(1)x_(2)))\n=((x_(2)−x_(1))(2x_(1)x_(2)−1))/(x_(1)x_(2))，\n因为x_(1)，x_(2)∈(1，+∞)且x_(1)<x_(2)，\n所以x_(2)-x_(1)>0，2x_(1)x_(2)-1>0，x_(1)x_(2)>0，\n所以f(x_(2))-f(x_(1))>0，即f(x_(2))>f(x_(1))，\n所以f(x)在(1，+∞)上单调递增.\n(3)由(2)知，函数f(x)在[2，3]上单调递增，\n则当x=2时，f(x)有最小值f(2)=(9)/(2)；\n当x=3时，f(x)有最大值f(3)=(19)/(3).", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K004", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": ["K003"], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "parameter_analysis"], "method_tags": ["monotonicity"], "estimated_time": 540, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.2　函数的单调性与最值.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.2　函数的单调性与最值", "source_question_number": "11.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 310–329", "source_sha256": "4a4da4a043a4a5f8afa3779129d634179d1dad121b475e710a0733c1cb0f34fb", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "approved", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。", "rubric 是审核草案，不进行自动评分；分值与评分点须人工确认。", "用户已基于可读版完成人工审核。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "confirmed", "reference_answer": "(1)因为f(x)=2x-(a)/(x)，且f(2)=(9)/(2)，\n所以4-(a)/(2)=(9)/(2)，解得a=-1.\n(2)函数f(x)在(1，+∞)上单调递增.证明如下：\n由(1)可得，f(x)=2x+(1)/(x)，\n任取x_(1)，x_(2)∈(1，+∞)，x_(1)<x_(2)，\n则f(x_(2))-f(x_(1))=2x_(2)+(1)/(x_(2))-(2x_(1)+(1)/(x_(1)))\n=2(x_(2)-x_(1))+((1)/(x_(2))−(1)/(x_(1)))\n=2(x_(2)-x_(1))+(x_(1)−x_(2))/(x_(1)x_(2))=(x_(2)-x_(1))(2−(1)/(x_(1)x_(2)))\n=((x_(2)−x_(1))(2x_(1)x_(2)−1))/(x_(1)x_(2))，\n因为x_(1)，x_(2)∈(1，+∞)且x_(1)<x_(2)，\n所以x_(2)-x_(1)>0，2x_(1)x_(2)-1>0，x_(1)x_(2)>0，\n所以f(x_(2))-f(x_(1))>0，即f(x_(2))>f(x_(1))，\n所以f(x)在(1，+∞)上单调递增.\n(3)由(2)知，函数f(x)在[2，3]上单调递增，\n则当x=2时，f(x)有最小值f(2)=(9)/(2)；\n当x=3时，f(x)有最大值f(3)=(19)/(3).", "solution_steps": ["(1)因为f(x)=2x-(a)/(x)，且f(2)=(9)/(2)，", "所以4-(a)/(2)=(9)/(2)，解得a=-1.", "(2)函数f(x)在(1，+∞)上单调递增.证明如下：", "由(1)可得，f(x)=2x+(1)/(x)，", "任取x_(1)，x_(2)∈(1，+∞)，x_(1)<x_(2)，", "则f(x_(2))-f(x_(1))=2x_(2)+(1)/(x_(2))-(2x_(1)+(1)/(x_(1)))", "=2(x_(2)-x_(1))+((1)/(x_(2))−(1)/(x_(1)))", "=2(x_(2)-x_(1))+(x_(1)−x_(2))/(x_(1)x_(2))=(x_(2)-x_(1))(2−(1)/(x_(1)x_(2)))", "=((x_(2)−x_(1))(2x_(1)x_(2)−1))/(x_(1)x_(2))，", "因为x_(1)，x_(2)∈(1，+∞)且x_(1)<x_(2)，", "所以x_(2)-x_(1)>0，2x_(1)x_(2)-1>0，x_(1)x_(2)>0，", "所以f(x_(2))-f(x_(1))>0，即f(x_(2))>f(x_(1))，", "所以f(x)在(1，+∞)上单调递增.", "(3)由(2)知，函数f(x)在[2，3]上单调递增，", "则当x=2时，f(x)有最小值f(2)=(9)/(2)；", "当x=3时，f(x)有最大值f(3)=(19)/(3)."], "rubric": [{"criterion": "第1问：求实数a的值", "score": 3}, {"criterion": "第2问：判断函数f(x)在(1，+∞)上的单调性，并用定义证明", "score": 6}, {"criterion": "第3问：求函数f(x)在[2，3]上的最值", "score": 4}], "max_score": 13, "rubric_status": "pending_review", "rubric_basis": "原题分问标注；未标分时为2分/问的草案，需人工校准", "fingerprint": "914da982fa54641d0a079e95d1d3ea2905aa78bbd82b83f20d9d6e69044491ae", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": [], "reviewed_by": "manual_user", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-06T15:08:54.379484+00:00", "review_confirmation": {"reviewer": "manual_user", "confirmed": true}}
{"id": "FS-83b67d7e75f29757", "question_type": "subjective", "stem": "12.(15分)函数f(x)和g(x)具有如下性质：①定义域均为R；②f(x)为奇函数，g(x)为偶函数；③f(x)+g(x)=e^(x)(常数e是自然对数的底数).\n(1)求函数f(x)和g(x)的解析式；(7分)\n(2)对任意实数x，[g(x)]^(2)-[f(x)]^(2)是否为定值，若是，请求出该定值；若不是，请说明理由.(8分)", "explanation": "(1)由性质③f(x)+g(x)=e^(x)，\n则f(-x)+g(-x)=e^(-x)，\n由性质②知f(-x)=-f(x)，g(-x)=g(x)，故-f(x)+g(x)=e^(-x).\n则{f(x)+g(x)=e^(x),; −f(x)+g(x)=e^(−x),}\n解得f(x)=(e^(x)−e^(−x))/(2)，g(x)=(e^(x)+e^(−x))/(2).\n(2)由(1)可得[g(x)]^(2)-[f(x)]^(2)\n=((e^(x)+e^(−x))/(2))^(2)-((e^(x)−e^(−x))/(2))^(2)\n=(e^(2x)+e^(−2x)+2)/(4)-(e^(2x)+e^(−2x)−2)/(4)=1，\n故对任意实数x，[g(x)]^(2)-[f(x)]^(2)为定值，定值为1.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K005", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["definition", "symmetry"], "estimated_time": 360, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.3　函数的奇偶性.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.3　函数的奇偶性", "source_question_number": "12.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 318–329", "source_sha256": "2b98749942d46405dc0feb9ed1acfc75b54a012461b9fd5891e462e26657f25e", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "approved", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。", "rubric 是审核草案，不进行自动评分；分值与评分点须人工确认。", "用户已基于可读版完成人工审核。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "confirmed", "reference_answer": "(1)由性质③f(x)+g(x)=e^(x)，\n则f(-x)+g(-x)=e^(-x)，\n由性质②知f(-x)=-f(x)，g(-x)=g(x)，故-f(x)+g(x)=e^(-x).\n则{f(x)+g(x)=e^(x),; −f(x)+g(x)=e^(−x),}\n解得f(x)=(e^(x)−e^(−x))/(2)，g(x)=(e^(x)+e^(−x))/(2).\n(2)由(1)可得[g(x)]^(2)-[f(x)]^(2)\n=((e^(x)+e^(−x))/(2))^(2)-((e^(x)−e^(−x))/(2))^(2)\n=(e^(2x)+e^(−2x)+2)/(4)-(e^(2x)+e^(−2x)−2)/(4)=1，\n故对任意实数x，[g(x)]^(2)-[f(x)]^(2)为定值，定值为1.", "solution_steps": ["(1)由性质③f(x)+g(x)=e^(x)，", "则f(-x)+g(-x)=e^(-x)，", "由性质②知f(-x)=-f(x)，g(-x)=g(x)，故-f(x)+g(x)=e^(-x).", "则{f(x)+g(x)=e^(x),; −f(x)+g(x)=e^(−x),}", "得f(x)=(e^(x)−e^(−x))/(2)，g(x)=(e^(x)+e^(−x))/(2).", "(2)由(1)可得[g(x)]^(2)-[f(x)]^(2)", "=((e^(x)+e^(−x))/(2))^(2)-((e^(x)−e^(−x))/(2))^(2)", "=(e^(2x)+e^(−2x)+2)/(4)-(e^(2x)+e^(−2x)−2)/(4)=1，", "故对任意实数x，[g(x)]^(2)-[f(x)]^(2)为定值，定值为1."], "rubric": [{"criterion": "第1问：求函数f(x)和g(x)的解析式", "score": 7}, {"criterion": "第2问：对任意实数x，[g(x)]^(2)-[f(x)]^(2)是否为定值，若是，请求出该定值；若不是，请说明理由", "score": 8}], "max_score": 15, "rubric_status": "pending_review", "rubric_basis": "原题分问标注；未标分时为2分/问的草案，需人工校准", "fingerprint": "9850825fd123aa9c57fe327fb28bcdd5c2510b8e5d4f40dbbb87717ac4f459ae", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": [], "reviewed_by": "manual_user", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-06T15:08:54.379484+00:00", "review_confirmation": {"reviewer": "manual_user", "confirmed": true}}
{"id": "FS-c9dbc429eebe40b6", "question_type": "subjective", "stem": "10.(链接教材，人教A版必修第一册P87习题3.2 T13)(14分)函数y=f(x)的图象关于点P(a，b)成中心对称的充要条件是函数y=f(x+a)-b为奇函数.\n(1)若f(x)=x^(3)-3x^(2)，求此函数图象的对称中心；(9分)\n(2)类比上述推广结论，写出“函数y=f(x)的图象关于y轴成轴对称的充要条件是函数y=f(x)为偶函数”的一个推广结论.(5分)", "explanation": "(1)设函数f(x)=x^(3)-3x^(2)的图象的对称中心为点P(a，b)，g(x)=f(x+a)-b，\n则g(x)为奇函数，故g(-x)=-g(x)，\n故f(-x+a)-b=-f(x+a)+b，\n即f(-x+a)+f(x+a)=2b，\n即[(-x+a)^(3)-3(-x+a)^(2)]+[(x+a)^(3)-3(x+a)^(2)]=2b.\n整理得(3a-3)x^(2)+a^(3)-3a^(2)-b=0，\n故{3a−3=0,; a^(3)−3a^(2)−b=0,}解得{a=1,; b=−2,}\n所以函数f(x)=x^(3)-3x^(2)的图象的对称中心为(1，-2).\n(2)推论：函数y=f(x)的图象关于直线x=a成轴对称的充要条件是函数y=f(x+a)为偶函数.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K006", "related_knowledge_point_ids": ["K005"], "question_prerequisite_ids": ["K005"], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["definition", "symmetry"], "estimated_time": 540, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.4　函数的周期性和对称性.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.4　函数的周期性和对称性", "source_question_number": "10.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 283–294", "source_sha256": "25d7a7bc92d4bc1b26b7b8da5051d6538bd27288a37b004ba4235b042f40b32f", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "approved", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。", "rubric 是审核草案，不进行自动评分；分值与评分点须人工确认。", "用户已基于可读版完成人工审核。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "confirmed", "reference_answer": "(1)设函数f(x)=x^(3)-3x^(2)的图象的对称中心为点P(a，b)，g(x)=f(x+a)-b，\n则g(x)为奇函数，故g(-x)=-g(x)，\n故f(-x+a)-b=-f(x+a)+b，\n即f(-x+a)+f(x+a)=2b，\n即[(-x+a)^(3)-3(-x+a)^(2)]+[(x+a)^(3)-3(x+a)^(2)]=2b.\n整理得(3a-3)x^(2)+a^(3)-3a^(2)-b=0，\n故{3a−3=0,; a^(3)−3a^(2)−b=0,}解得{a=1,; b=−2,}\n所以函数f(x)=x^(3)-3x^(2)的图象的对称中心为(1，-2).\n(2)推论：函数y=f(x)的图象关于直线x=a成轴对称的充要条件是函数y=f(x+a)为偶函数.", "solution_steps": ["(1)设函数f(x)=x^(3)-3x^(2)的图象的对称中心为点P(a，b)，g(x)=f(x+a)-b，", "则g(x)为奇函数，故g(-x)=-g(x)，", "故f(-x+a)-b=-f(x+a)+b，", "即f(-x+a)+f(x+a)=2b，", "即[(-x+a)^(3)-3(-x+a)^(2)]+[(x+a)^(3)-3(x+a)^(2)]=2b.", "整理得(3a-3)x^(2)+a^(3)-3a^(2)-b=0，", "故{3a−3=0,; a^(3)−3a^(2)−b=0,}解得{a=1,; b=−2,}", "所以函数f(x)=x^(3)-3x^(2)的图象的对称中心为(1，-2).", "(2)推论：函数y=f(x)的图象关于直线x=a成轴对称的充要条件是函数y=f(x+a)为偶函数."], "rubric": [{"criterion": "第1问：若f(x)=x^(3)-3x^(2)，求此函数图象的对称中心", "score": 9}, {"criterion": "第2问：类比上述推广结论，写出“函数y=f(x)的图象关于y轴成轴对称的充要条件是函数y=f(x)为偶函数”的一个推广结论", "score": 5}], "max_score": 14, "rubric_status": "pending_review", "rubric_basis": "原题分问标注；未标分时为2分/问的草案，需人工校准", "fingerprint": "72f9a8e50fa35312a0bed340cef5898ac7e0f74c7b51bf536e37c8dd88a5f41a", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": [], "reviewed_by": "manual_user", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-06T15:08:54.379484+00:00", "review_confirmation": {"reviewer": "manual_user", "confirmed": true}}
{"id": "FS-9a0953f912e79012", "question_type": "subjective", "stem": "例2　已知二次函数f(x)满足f(2)=-1，f(-1)=-1，且f(x)的最大值是8，试确定该二次函数的解析式.", "explanation": "方法一　(利用“一般式”解题)\n设f(x)=ax^(2)+bx+c(a≠0).\n由题意得{4a+2b+c=−1,; a−b+c=−1,; (4ac−b^(2))/(4a)=8,}解得{a=−4,; b=4,; c=7.}\n所以所求二次函数的解析式为f(x)=-4x^(2)+4x+7.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K004", "related_knowledge_point_ids": ["K007"], "question_prerequisite_ids": ["K007"], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["monotonicity"], "estimated_time": 360, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.5　二次函数与幂函数.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.5　二次函数与幂函数", "source_question_number": "例2", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 114–118", "source_sha256": "f3e07be2e9eb04b2560d04dfa55eae9b881bcf6b1a2087c16269f81e846ee462", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "approved", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。", "rubric 是审核草案，不进行自动评分；分值与评分点须人工确认。", "用户已基于可读版完成人工审核。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "confirmed", "reference_answer": "方法一　(利用“一般式”解题)\n设f(x)=ax^(2)+bx+c(a≠0).\n由题意得{4a+2b+c=−1,; a−b+c=−1,; (4ac−b^(2))/(4a)=8,}解得{a=−4,; b=4,; c=7.}\n所以所求二次函数的解析式为f(x)=-4x^(2)+4x+7.", "solution_steps": ["方法一　(利用“一般式”解题)", "设f(x)=ax^(2)+bx+c(a≠0).", "由题意得{4a+2b+c=−1,; a−b+c=−1,; (4ac−b^(2))/(4a)=8,}解得{a=−4,; b=4,; c=7.}", "所以所求二次函数的解析式为f(x)=-4x^(2)+4x+7."], "rubric": [{"criterion": "写出合法条件与所用方法", "score": 2}, {"criterion": "完成推导并给出符合条件的结论", "score": 4}], "max_score": 6, "rubric_status": "pending_review", "rubric_basis": "原题分问标注；未标分时为2分/问的草案，需人工校准", "fingerprint": "b22bab2716b366247067316a3e070759896d49b177ce579dff318eebc71a3cbb", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": [], "reviewed_by": "manual_user", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-06T15:08:54.379484+00:00", "review_confirmation": {"re