{"id": "FS-27270c2ac86626cc", "question_type": "subjective", "stem": "11.(13分)(2026·莆田模拟)已知函数f(x)=((1)/(3))^(ax^(2)−4x+3)(a∈R).\n(1)若a=-2，求f(x)的单调区间；(6分)\n(2)若f(x)有最大值3，求a的值.(7分)", "explanation": "(1)当a=-2时，f(x)=((1)/(3))^(−2x^(2)−4x+3)的定义域为R，\n令t=-2x^(2)-4x+3=-2(x+1)^(2)+5≤5，\n因为t=-2x^(2)-4x+3在(-∞，-1)上单调递增，在(-1，+∞)上单调递减，\n且y=((1)/(3))^(t)在t∈(-∞，5]上单调递减，\n所以f(x)在(-∞，-1)上单调递减，在(-1，+∞)上单调递增，\n即f(x)的单调递增区间是(-1，+∞)，单调递减区间是(-∞，-1).\n(2)令g(x)=ax^(2)-4x+3，f(x)=((1)/(3))^(g(x))，\n由于f(x)有最大值3，所以g(x)应有最小值-1，\n因此必有{a>0,; g((2)/(a))=(3a−4)/(a)=−1,}\n解得a=1，即当f(x)有最大值3时，a的值为1.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K004", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": ["K003"], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["monotonicity"], "estimated_time": 540, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.6　指数与指数函数.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.6　指数与指数函数", "source_question_number": "11.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 328–340", "source_sha256": "ec6f7661553cca7157518fc1cf4a9380542f8134559850d06c43bcbe2eb65b0e", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "approved", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。", "rubric 是审核草案，不进行自动评分；分值与评分点须人工确认。", "用户已基于可读版完成人工审核。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "confirmed", "reference_answer": "(1)当a=-2时，f(x)=((1)/(3))^(−2x^(2)−4x+3)的定义域为R，\n令t=-2x^(2)-4x+3=-2(x+1)^(2)+5≤5，\n因为t=-2x^(2)-4x+3在(-∞，-1)上单调递增，在(-1，+∞)上单调递减，\n且y=((1)/(3))^(t)在t∈(-∞，5]上单调递减，\n所以f(x)在(-∞，-1)上单调递减，在(-1，+∞)上单调递增，\n即f(x)的单调递增区间是(-1，+∞)，单调递减区间是(-∞，-1).\n(2)令g(x)=ax^(2)-4x+3，f(x)=((1)/(3))^(g(x))，\n由于f(x)有最大值3，所以g(x)应有最小值-1，\n因此必有{a>0,; g((2)/(a))=(3a−4)/(a)=−1,}\n解得a=1，即当f(x)有最大值3时，a的值为1.", "solution_steps": ["(1)当a=-2时，f(x)=((1)/(3))^(−2x^(2)−4x+3)的定义域为R，", "令t=-2x^(2)-4x+3=-2(x+1)^(2)+5≤5，", "因为t=-2x^(2)-4x+3在(-∞，-1)上单调递增，在(-1，+∞)上单调递减，", "且y=((1)/(3))^(t)在t∈(-∞，5]上单调递减，", "所以f(x)在(-∞，-1)上单调递减，在(-1，+∞)上单调递增，", "即f(x)的单调递增区间是(-1，+∞)，单调递减区间是(-∞，-1).", "(2)令g(x)=ax^(2)-4x+3，f(x)=((1)/(3))^(g(x))，", "由于f(x)有最大值3，所以g(x)应有最小值-1，", "因此必有{a>0,; g((2)/(a))=(3a−4)/(a)=−1,}", "得a=1，即当f(x)有最大值3时，a的值为1."], "rubric": [{"criterion": "第1问：若a=-2，求f(x)的单调区间", "score": 6}, {"criterion": "第2问：若f(x)有最大值3，求a的值", "score": 7}], "max_score": 13, "rubric_status": "pending_review", "rubric_basis": "原题分问标注；未标分时为2分/问的草案，需人工校准", "fingerprint": "ee76300286ea5feccd973538d33220c16d2f44ffbda89361a73d167374421b3a", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": [], "reviewed_by": "manual_user", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-06T15:08:54.379484+00:00", "review_confirmation": {"reviewer": "manual_user", "confirmed": true}}
{"id": "FS-a5ec8a989adf8327", "question_type": "subjective", "stem": "11.(13分)(2025·南昌模拟)已知函数f(x)=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)+kx是偶函数.\n(1)求k的值；(6分)\n(2)解不等式f(x)≥log_(3)(7·3^(x)-1).(7分)", "explanation": "(1)∵f(x)是偶函数，\n∴f(-x)=f(x)，\n即log_(3)(9^(-x)+1)-kx=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)+kx对任意x∈R恒成立，\n∴2kx=log_(3)(9^(-x)+1)-log_(3)(9^(x)+1)\n=log_(3)(9^(−x)+1)/(9^(x)+1)=log_(3)3^(-2x)=-2x，\n∴k=-1.\n(2)由(1)得f(x)=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)-x=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)-log_(3)3^(x)=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)/(3^(x))=log_(3)(3^(x)+3^(-x))，\n则不等式f(x)≥log_(3)(7·3^(x)-1)等价于3^(x)+3^(-x)≥7·3^(x)-1>0，\n由7·3^(x)-1>0，解得x>-log_(3)7；\n由3^(x)+3^(-x)≥7·3^(x)-1，\n得6·(3^(x))^(2)-3^(x)-1≤0，\n得0<3^(x)≤(1)/(2)，\n即x≤-log_(3)2，\n综上，不等式的解集为{x|-log_(3)7<x≤-log_(3)2}.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K005", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["definition", "symmetry"], "estimated_time": 360, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.7　对数与对数函数.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.7　对数与对数函数", "source_question_number": "11.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 279–295", "source_sha256": "4e670ab7e922a6620ab14b5ad2aeb1b90cfc2e4a96ce6e02f27dd7d3508f9568", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "approved", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。", "rubric 是审核草案，不进行自动评分；分值与评分点须人工确认。", "用户已基于可读版完成人工审核。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "confirmed", "reference_answer": "(1)∵f(x)是偶函数，\n∴f(-x)=f(x)，\n即log_(3)(9^(-x)+1)-kx=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)+kx对任意x∈R恒成立，\n∴2kx=log_(3)(9^(-x)+1)-log_(3)(9^(x)+1)\n=log_(3)(9^(−x)+1)/(9^(x)+1)=log_(3)3^(-2x)=-2x，\n∴k=-1.\n(2)由(1)得f(x)=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)-x=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)-log_(3)3^(x)=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)/(3^(x))=log_(3)(3^(x)+3^(-x))，\n则不等式f(x)≥log_(3)(7·3^(x)-1)等价于3^(x)+3^(-x)≥7·3^(x)-1>0，\n由7·3^(x)-1>0，解得x>-log_(3)7；\n由3^(x)+3^(-x)≥7·3^(x)-1，\n得6·(3^(x))^(2)-3^(x)-1≤0，\n得0<3^(x)≤(1)/(2)，\n即x≤-log_(3)2，\n综上，不等式的解集为{x|-log_(3)7<x≤-log_(3)2}.", "solution_steps": ["(1)∵f(x)是偶函数，", "∴f(-x)=f(x)，", "即log_(3)(9^(-x)+1)-kx=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)+kx对任意x∈R恒成立，", "∴2kx=log_(3)(9^(-x)+1)-log_(3)(9^(x)+1)", "=log_(3)(9^(−x)+1)/(9^(x)+1)=log_(3)3^(-2x)=-2x，", "∴k=-1.", "(2)由(1)得f(x)=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)-x=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)-log_(3)3^(x)=log_(3)(9^(x)+1)/(3^(x))=log_(3)(3^(x)+3^(-x))，", "则不等式f(x)≥log_(3)(7·3^(x)-1)等价于3^(x)+3^(-x)≥7·3^(x)-1>0，", "由7·3^(x)-1>0，解得x>-log_(3)7；", "由3^(x)+3^(-x)≥7·3^(x)-1，", "得6·(3^(x))^(2)-3^(x)-1≤0，", "得0<3^(x)≤(1)/(2)，", "即x≤-log_(3)2，", "综上，不等式的解集为{x|-log_(3)7<x≤-log_(3)2}."], "rubric": [{"criterion": "第1问：求k的值", "score": 6}, {"criterion": "第2问：解不等式f(x)≥log_(3)(7·3^(x)-1)", "score": 7}], "max_score": 13, "rubric_status": "pending_review", "rubric_basis": "原题分问标注；未标分时为2分/问的草案，需人工校准", "fingerprint": "cec9fff15dd9d4e4a654249aa3232ace1057f6c53367d64ae3e2514feeb98c77", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": [], "reviewed_by": "manual_user", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-06T15:08:54.379484+00:00", "review_confirmation": {"reviewer": "manual_user", "confirmed": true}}
{"id": "FS-b5830f4d0341b40b", "question_type": "subjective", "stem": "已知f(x)是一次函数，且满足f(f(x))=4x-3，求f(x)的解析式；", "explanation": "(3)(待定系数法)∵f(x)是一次函数，\n∴设f(x)=kx+b(k≠0)，\n∴f(f(x))=k(kx+b)+b=k^(2)x+kb+b，\n又f(f(x))=4x-3，∴k^(2)x+kb+b=4x-3，\n故{k^(2)=4,; kb+b=−3,}解得{k=2,; b=−1}或{k=−2,; b=3,}\n∴f(x)=2x-1或f(x)=-2x+3.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K002", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "calculation"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 360, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.1　函数的概念及其表示.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.1　函数的概念及其表示", "source_question_number": null, "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 88–105", "source_sha256": "bfae8dfc6e13ba99cb9fbdb0e2a12574832dae6410fe637d5e24353e2a7730a1", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "approved", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。", "从独立小问提取；本小问已重述完整条件，不继承其他小问。评分表为草案。", "用户已基于可读版完成人工审核。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "confirmed", "reference_answer": "(3)(待定系数法)∵f(x)是一次函数，\n∴设f(x)=kx+b(k≠0)，\n∴f(f(x))=k(kx+b)+b=k^(2)x+kb+b，\n又f(f(x))=4x-3，∴k^(2)x+kb+b=4x-3，\n故{k^(2)=4,; kb+b=−3,}解得{k=2,; b=−1}或{k=−2,; b=3,}\n∴f(x)=2x-1或f(x)=-2x+3.", "solution_steps": ["(3)(待定系数法)∵f(x)是一次函数，", "∴设f(x)=kx+b(k≠0)，", "∴f(f(x))=k(kx+b)+b=k^(2)x+kb+b，", "又f(f(x))=4x-3，∴k^(2)x+kb+b=4x-3，", "故{k^(2)=4,; kb+b=−3,}解得{k=2,; b=−1}或{k=−2,; b=3,}", "∴f(x)=2x-1或f(x)=-2x+3."], "rubric": [{"criterion": "正确使用题设条件与方法", "score": 2}, {"criterion": "推导解析式并说明适用范围", "score": 4}], "max_score": 6, "rubric_status": "pending_review", "rubric_basis": "独立小问的评分草案，须人工确认", "source_subquestion": "3", "source_ranges": [[88, 88], [100, 105]], "fingerprint": "67c978b92b829f5c7cf98bb7a6de603a6d3e822a06f35f9ba6b1ccc85a9355f6", "vali