{"id": "FS-ddb6a44cdd8c3d26", "question_type": "subjective", "stem": "例1　(1)判断下列函数的奇偶性：\n①f(x)=sqrt(3−x^(2))+sqrt(x^(2)−3)；\n②f(x)=e^(x)+e^(-x)；\n③f(x)={x^(2)+x,x<0,; −x^(2)+x,x>0;}\n④f(x)=log_(2)(x+sqrt(x^(2)+1)).", "explanation": "①由{3−x^(2)≥0,; x^(2)−3≥0}得x^(2)=3，解得x=±sqrt(3)，\n即函数f(x)的定义域为{-sqrt(3)，sqrt(3)}，\n从而f(x)=sqrt(3−x^(2))+sqrt(x^(2)−3)=0.\n因此f(-x)=-f(x)且f(-x)=f(x)，∴函数f(x)既是奇函数又是偶函数.\n②显然函数f(x)的定义域为R，f(-x)=e^(-x)+e^(x)=f(x)，∴函数f(x)为偶函数.\n③显然函数f(x)的定义域为(-∞，0)∪(0，+∞)，关于原点对称.\n∵当x<0时，-x>0，则f(-x)=-(-x)^(2)-x=-x^(2)-x=-f(x)；\n当x>0时，-x<0，则f(-x)=(-x)^(2)-x=x^(2)-x=-f(x)；\n综上可知，对于定义域内的任意x，总有f(-x)=-f(x)，∴函数f(x)为奇函数.\n④∵x^(2)+1>x^(2)，∴sqrt(x^(2)+1)+x>0恒成立，\n即f(x)的定义域为R，\nf(-x)=log_(2)[-x+sqrt((−x)^(2)+1)]\n=log_(2)(sqrt(x^(2)+1)-x)=log_(2)(sqrt(x^(2)+1)+x)^(-1)\n=-log_(2)(sqrt(x^(2)+1)+x)=-f(x)，\n故f(x)为奇函数.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K005", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["definition", "symmetry"], "estimated_time": 540, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.3　函数的奇偶性.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.3　函数的奇偶性", "source_question_number": "例1　(1)", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 55–74", "source_sha256": "2b98749942d46405dc0feb9ed1acfc75b54a012461b9fd5891e462e26657f25e", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "approved", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。", "rubric 是审核草案，不进行自动评分；分值与评分点须人工确认。", "用户已基于可读版完成人工审核。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "confirmed", "reference_answer": "①由{3−x^(2)≥0,; x^(2)−3≥0}得x^(2)=3，解得x=±sqrt(3)，\n即函数f(x)的定义域为{-sqrt(3)，sqrt(3)}，\n从而f(x)=sqrt(3−x^(2))+sqrt(x^(2)−3)=0.\n因此f(-x)=-f(x)且f(-x)=f(x)，∴函数f(x)既是奇函数又是偶函数.\n②显然函数f(x)的定义域为R，f(-x)=e^(-x)+e^(x)=f(x)，∴函数f(x)为偶函数.\n③显然函数f(x)的定义域为(-∞，0)∪(0，+∞)，关于原点对称.\n∵当x<0时，-x>0，则f(-x)=-(-x)^(2)-x=-x^(2)-x=-f(x)；\n当x>0时，-x<0，则f(-x)=(-x)^(2)-x=x^(2)-x=-f(x)；\n综上可知，对于定义域内的任意x，总有f(-x)=-f(x)，∴函数f(x)为奇函数.\n④∵x^(2)+1>x^(2)，∴sqrt(x^(2)+1)+x>0恒成立，\n即f(x)的定义域为R，\nf(-x)=log_(2)[-x+sqrt((−x)^(2)+1)]\n=log_(2)(sqrt(x^(2)+1)-x)=log_(2)(sqrt(x^(2)+1)+x)^(-1)\n=-log_(2)(sqrt(x^(2)+1)+x)=-f(x)，\n故f(x)为奇函数.", "solution_steps": ["①由{3−x^(2)≥0,; x^(2)−3≥0}得x^(2)=3，解得x=±sqrt(3)，", "即函数f(x)的定义域为{-sqrt(3)，sqrt(3)}，", "从而f(x)=sqrt(3−x^(2))+sqrt(x^(2)−3)=0.", "因此f(-x)=-f(x)且f(-x)=f(x)，∴函数f(x)既是奇函数又是偶函数.", "②显然函数f(x)的定义域为R，f(-x)=e^(-x)+e^(x)=f(x)，∴函数f(x)为偶函数.", "③显然函数f(x)的定义域为(-∞，0)∪(0，+∞)，关于原点对称.", "∵当x<0时，-x>0，则f(-x)=-(-x)^(2)-x=-x^(2)-x=-f(x)；", "当x>0时，-x<0，则f(-x)=(-x)^(2)-x=x^(2)-x=-f(x)；", "综上可知，对于定义域内的任意x，总有f(-x)=-f(x)，∴函数f(x)为奇函数.", "④∵x^(2)+1>x^(2)，∴sqrt(x^(2)+1)+x>0恒成立，", "即f(x)的定义域为R，", "f(-x)=log_(2)[-x+sqrt((−x)^(2)+1)]", "=log_(2)(sqrt(x^(2)+1)-x)=log_(2)(sqrt(x^(2)+1)+x)^(-1)", "=-log_(2)(sqrt(x^(2)+1)+x)=-f(x)，", "故f(x)为奇函数."], "rubric": [{"criterion": "第①项：f(x)=sqrt(3−x^(2))+sqrt(x^(2)−3)；", "score": 2}, {"criterion": "第②项：f(x)=e^(x)+e^(-x)；", "score": 2}, {"criterion": "第③项：f(x)={x^(2)+x,x<0,; −x^(2)+x,x>0;}", "score": 2}, {"criterion": "第④项：f(x)=log_(2)(x+sqrt(x^(2)+1)).", "score": 2}], "max_score": 8, "rubric_status": "pending_review", "rubric_basis": "原题分问标注；未标分时为2分/问的草案，需人工校准", "fingerprint": "6c6b197ed1e01c0de163e9d254475fd9280f24235a1b45e34ecd5158141d83f0", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": [], "reviewed_by": "manual_user", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-06T15:08:54.379484+00:00", "review_confirmation": {"reviewer": "manual_user", "confirmed": true}}
{"id": "FS-d8d7d54caccd85a9", "question_type": "subjective", "stem": "11.(13分)(2025·咸阳模拟)已知函数g(x)=ax^(2)-4ax+1+b(a>0)在区间[1，3]上有最大值4和最小值1.\n(1)求a，b的值；(7分)\n(2)若函数g(x)在区间(m-1，2m)上不单调，求实数m的取值范围.(6分)", "explanation": "(1)由题意得g(x)图象的对称轴为直线x=-(−4a)/(2a)=2，\n所以当x=2时，g(x)取得最小值，当x=1或x=3时，g(x)取得最大值，\n则{g(2)=4a−8a+1+b=1,; g(1)=a−4a+1+b=4,}解得{b=12,; a=3.}\n(2)由(1)得g(x)=3x^(2)-12x+13，其图象的对称轴为直线x=2，\n若函数g(x)在区间(m-1，2m)上不单调，\n则m-1<2<2m，解得1<m<3，\n所以实数m的取值范围为(1，3).", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K004", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": ["K003"], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "parameter_analysis"], "method_tags": ["monotonicity"], "estimated_time": 540, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.5　二次函数与幂函数.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.5　二次函数与幂函数", "source_question_number": "11.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 311–320", "source_sha256": "f3e07be2e9eb04b2560d04dfa55eae9b881bcf6b1a2087c16269f81e846ee462", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "approved", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。", "rubric 是审核草案，不进行自动评分；分值与评分点须人工确认。", "用户已基于可读版完成人工审核。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "confirmed", "reference_answer": "(1)由题意得g(x)图象的对称轴为直线x=-(−4a)/(2a)=2，\n所以当x=2时，g(x)取得最小值，当x=1或x=3时，g(x)取得最大值，\n则{g(2)=4a−8a+1+b=1,; g(1)=a−4a+1+b=4,}解得{b=12,; a=3.}\n(2)由(1)得g(x)=3x^(2)-12x+13，其图象的对称轴为直线x=2，\n若函数g(x)在区间(m-1，2m)上不单调，\n则m-1<2<2m，解得1<m<3，\n所以实数m的取值范围为(1，3).", "solution_steps": ["(1)由题意得g(x)图象的对称轴为直线x=-(−4a)/(2a)=2，", "所以当x=2时，g(x)取得最小值，当x=1或x=3时，g(x)取得最大值，", "则{g(2)=4a−8a+1+b=1,; g(1)=a−4a+1+b=4,}解得{b=12,; a=3.}", "(2)由(1)得g(x)=3x^(2)-12x+13，其图象的对称轴为直线x=2，", "若函数g(x)在区间(m-1，2m)上不单调，", "则m-1<2<2m，解得1<m<3，", "所以实数m的取值范围为(1，3)."], "rubric": [{"criterion": "第1问：求a，b的值", "score": 7}, {"criterion": "第2问：若函数g(x)在区间(m-1，2m)上不单调，求实数m的取值范围", "score": 6}], "max_score": 13, "rubric_status": "pending_review", "rubric_basis": "原题分问标注；未标分时为2分/问的草案，需人工校准", "fingerprint": "f47e8f3efdeafdf109805ccaea101e4dc5628cd86235624b5d10e2b3984d14cc", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": [], "reviewed_by": "manual_user", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-06T15:08:54.379484+00:00", "review_confirmation": {"reviewer": "manual_user", "confirmed": true}}
{"id": "FS-be1967c65a5642eb", "question_type": "subjective", "stem": "例5　(2025·合肥期末)已知定义域为R的函数f(x)=(−e^(x)+a)/(e^(x)+1)是奇函数.\n(1)求实数a的值；\n(2)判断函数f(x)的单调性，并说明理由；\n(3)若不等式f(m·3^(x))+f(3^(x)-9^(x)-2)>0对任意的x≥0恒成立，求实数m的取值范围.", "explanation": "(1)由f(x)是定义在R上的奇函数，\n得f(0)=(−e^(0)+a)/(e^(0)+1)=(−1+a)/(2)=0，\n解得a=1，经检验，a=1符合题意，\n所以a=1.\n(2)函数f(x)在R上是减函数，理由如下.\n由(1)知f(x)=(1−e^(x))/(e^(x)+1)=(2)/(e^(x)+1)-1，\n因为函数y=e^(x)+1在R上单调递增，\n所以函数y=(2)/(e^(x)+1)在R上单调递减，\n所以函数f(x)=(2)/(e^(x)+1)-1在R上单调递减，\n即函数f(x)在R上是减函数.\n(3)由f(m·3^(x))+f(3^(x)-9^(x)-2)>0，\n得f(m·3^(x))>-f(3^(x)-9^(x)-2)=f(9^(x)-3^(x)+2)，\n由(2)知，f(x)是R上的减函数，\n则m·3^(x)<9^(x)-3^(x)+2，\n即m<(9^(x)−3^(x)+2)/(3^(x))=3^(x)+(2)/(3^(x))-1，\n依题意，m<3^(x)+(2)/(3^(x))-1对任意的x≥0恒成立，\n而3^(x)≥1，则3^(x)+(2)/(3^(x))-1≥2sqrt(3^(x)·(2)/(3^(x)))-1=2sqrt(2)-1，当且仅当3^(x)=(2)/(3^(x))，即3^(x)=sqrt(2)时取等号，\n因此m<2sqrt(2)-1，\n所以实数m的取值范围是(-∞，2sqrt(2)-1).", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K005", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": ["K003"], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "parameter_analysis"], "method_tags": ["definition", "symmetry"], "estimated_time": 540, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.6　指数与指数函数.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.6　指数与指数函数", "source_question_number": "例5", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 153–175", "source_sha256": "ec6f7661553cca7157518fc1cf4a9380542f8134559850d06c43bcbe2eb65b0e", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "approved", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。", "rubric 是审核草案，不进行自动评分；分值与评分点须人工确认。", "用户已基于可读版完成人工审核。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "confirmed", "reference_answer": "(1)由f(x)是定义在R上的奇函数，\n得f(0)=(−e^(0)+a)/(e^(0)+1)=(−1+a)/(2)=0，\n解得a=1，经检验，a=1符合题意，\n所以a=1.\n(2)函数f(x)在R上是减函数，理由如下.\n由(1)知f(x)=(1−e^(x))/(e^(x)+1)=(2)/(e^(x)+1)-1，\n因为函数y=e^(x)+1在R上单调递增，\n所以函数y=(2)/(e^(x)+1)在R上单调递减，\n所以函数f(x)=(2)/(e^(x)+1)-1在R上单调递减，\n即函数f(x)在R上是减函数.\n(3)由f(m·3^(x))+f(3^(x)-9^(x)-2)>0，\n得f(m·3^(x))>-f(3^(x)-9^(x)-2)=f(9^(x)-3^(x)+2)，\n由(2)知，f(x)是R上的减函数，\n则m·3^(x)<9^(x)-3^(x)+2，\n即m<(9^(x)−3^(x)+2)/(3^(x))=3^(x)+(2)/(3^(x))-1，\n依题意，m<3^(x)+(2)/(3^(x))-1对任意的x≥0恒成立，\n而3^(x)≥1，则3^(x)+(2)/(3^(x))-1≥2sqrt(3^(x)·(2)/(3^(x)))-1=2sqrt(2)-1，当且仅当3^(x)=(2)/(3^(x))，即3^(x)=sqrt(2)时取等号，\n因此m<2sqrt(2)-1，\n所以实数m的取值范围是(-∞，2sqrt(2)-1).", "solution_steps": ["(1)由f(x)是定义在R上的奇函数，", "得f(0)=(−e^(0)+a)/(e^(0)+1)=(−1+a)/(2)=0，", "得a=1，经检验，a=1符合题意，", "所以a=1.", "(2)函数f(x)在R上是减函数，理由如下.", "由(1)知f(x)=(1−e^(x))/(e^(x)+1)=(2)/(e^(x)+1)-1，", "因为函数y=e^(x)+1在R上单调递增，", "所以函数y=(2)/(e^(x)+1)在R上单调递减，", "所以函数f(x)=(2)/(e^(x)+1)-1在R上单调递减，", "即函数f(x)在R上是减函数.", "(3)由f(m·3^(x))+f(3^(x)-9^(x)-2)>0，", "得f(m·3^(x))>-f(3^(x)-9^(x)-2)=f(9^(x)-3^(x)+2)，", "由(2)知，f(x)是R上的减函数，", "则m·3^(x)<9^(x)-3^(x)+2，", "即m<(9^(x)−3^(x)+2)/(3^(x))=3^(x)+(2)/(3^(x))-1，", "依题意，m<3^(x)+(2)/(3^(x))-1对任意的x≥0恒成立，", "而3^(x)≥1，则3^(x)+(2)/(3^(x))-1≥2sqrt(3^(x)·(2)/(3^(x)))-1=2sqrt(2)-1，当且仅当3^(x)=(2)/(3^(x))，即3^(x)=sqrt(2)时取等号，", "因此m<2sqrt(2)-1，", "所以实数m的取值范围是(-∞，2sqrt(2)-1)."], "rubric": [{"criterion": "第1问：求实数a的值；", "score": 2}, {"criterion": "第2问：判断函数f(x)的单调性，并说明理由；", "score": 2}, {"criterion": "第3问：若不等式f(m·3^(x))+f(3^(x)-9^(x)-2)>0对任意的x≥0恒成立，求实数m的取值范围.", "score": 2}], "max_score": 6, "rubric_status": "pending_review", "rubric_basis": "原题分问标注；未标分时为2分/问的草案，需人工校准", "fingerprint": "eefcad8dde5207d36677f3d41ed18606157bd41c1adafa6c4c14f92d34dd943c", "validation_errors": [], "validation_warnings": [], "reviewed_by": "manual_user", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-06T15:08:54.379484+00:00", "review_confirmation": {"reviewer": "manual_user", "confirmed": true}}
{"id": "FS-3b89764fc778ddb3", "question_type": "subjective", "stem": "已知f(x^(2)+(1)/(x^(2)))=x^(4)+(1)/(x^(4))，求f(x)的解析式；", "explanation": "(2)(配凑法)f (x^(2)+(1)/(x^(2)))=x^(4)+(1)/(x^(4))=(x^(2)+(1)/(x^(2)))^(2)-2，\n又x^(2)+(1)/(x^(2))≥2sqrt(x^(2)·(1)/(x^(2)))=2，\n当且仅当x^(2)=(1)/(x^(2))，即x=±1时等号成立.\n设t=x^(2)+(1)/(x^(2))，则t≥2，∴f(t)=t^(2)-2(t≥2)，\n∴f(x)=x^(2)-2(x≥2).", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K002", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "calculation"], "method_tags": ["definition"], "estimated_time": 360, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.1　函数的概念及其表示.docx", "source_section": "第二章　§2.1　函数的概念及其表示", "source_question_number": null, "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 87–99", "source_sha256": "bfae8dfc6e13ba99cb9fbdb0e2a12574832dae6410fe637d5e24353e2a7730a1", "source_url": null, "license": null, "usage_note": "本地提供的 DOCX 提取；来源许可待人工核实，不自动批准或发布。", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "approved", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度、答案格式为规则草标，需人工审核；尚未批准。", "从独立小问提取；本小问已重述完整条件，不继承其他小问。评分表为草案。", "用户已基于可读版完成人工审核。"], "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "confirmed", "reference_answer": "(2)(配凑法)f (x^(2)+(1)/(x^(2)))=x^(4)+(1)/(x^(4))=(x^(2)+(1)/(x^(2)))^(2)-2，\n又x^(2)+(1)/(x^(2))≥2sqrt(x^(2)·(1)/(x^(2)))=2，\n当且仅当x^(2)=(1)/(x^(2))，即x=±1时等号成立.\n设t=x^(2)+(1)/(x^(2))，则t≥2，∴f(t)=t^(2)-2(t≥2)，\n∴f(x)=x^(2)-2(x≥2).", "solution_steps": ["(2)(配凑法)f (x^(2)+(1)/(x^(2)))=x^(4)+(1)/(x^(4))=(x^(2)+(1)/(x^(2)))^(2)-2，", "又x^(2)+(1)/(x^(2))≥2sqrt(x^(2)·(1)/(x^(2)))=2，", "当且仅当x^(2)=(1)/(x^(2))，即x=±1时等号成立.", "设t=x^(2)+(1)/(x^(2))，则t≥2，∴f(t)=t^(2)-2(t≥2)，", "∴f(x)=x^(2)-2(x≥2)."], "rubric": [{"criterion": "正确使用题设条件与方法", "score": 2}, {"criterion": "推导解析式并说明适用范围", "score": 4}], "max_score": 6, "rubric_status": "pending_review", "rubric_basis": "独立小问的评分草案，须人工确认", "source_subquesti